{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-2","content":"性騷擾防治法第2條：本法處理性侵害犯罪以外、違反他人意願且與性或性別相關的行為。行為造成損害尊嚴、畏怖、敵意或冒犯的情境，或以順從、拒絕作為學習、工作等權益條件，可能落入本條。權勢性騷擾涉及在監督、照護或指導關係中利用權勢或機會。個案仍須依事實判斷。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第2條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"2","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:2"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=2","version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-9","content":"性騷擾防治法第9條：政府機關（構）、部隊、學校、機構或僱用人，不得對在性騷擾事件申訴、調查、偵查或審理程序中，為申訴、告訴、告發、提起訴訟、作證、提供協助或其他參與行為的人，為不當之差別待遇。違反前述規定者，負損害賠償責任。個案仍須核對具體待遇與程序參與事實。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第9條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"9","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:9"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=9","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-12","content":"性騷擾防治法第12條：對他人為性騷擾者，負損害賠償責任；即使屬非財產上損害，也得請求賠償相當金額。名譽受侵害者，得請求回復名譽之適當處分。依前述規定負賠償責任且屬權勢性騷擾者，法院得因被害人請求，依侵害情節酌定損害額一倍至三倍之懲罰性賠償金。具體是否構成及賠償額仍須依個案事實判斷。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第12條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"12","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:12"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=12","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-14","content":"性騷擾防治法第14條：非權勢性騷擾，申訴須在知悉事件後二年內，且事件發生後未逾五年；權勢性騷擾，知悉後三年內，且發生後未逾七年。事件時被害人未成年者，可於成年後三年內申訴；若前述期限較長，適用較長期限。申訴受理對象依行為人身分及事件條件而異，個案應核對事件日期與適用版本。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第14條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"14","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:14"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=14","version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","article_effective_date":"2024-03-08","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","effective_date":"2024-03-08","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-N0030014-13","content":"性別平等工作法第13條：雇主應採取防治性騷擾的措施。僱用十人以上、未達三十人者須訂定申訴管道並在工作場所公開揭示；三十人以上者須訂定防治措施、申訴及懲戒規範並公開揭示。雇主知悉性騷擾時須依知悉途徑採取立即有效的糾正與補救措施。向地方主管機關申訴的條件與期限另依同法第32條之1等規定核對。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等工作法第13條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等工作法","law_code":"N0030014","article_number":"13","lookup_keys":["性別平等工作法:13"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=N0030014&flno=13","version":"N0030014@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","article_effective_date":"2024-03-08","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=N0030014","effective_date":"2024-03-08","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-1","content":"性騷擾防治法第1條：性騷擾事件的處理與防治原則上依本法；若依事件場域及當事人身分關係，性別平等教育法或性別平等工作法另有規定，應依各該法律。先確認校園、職場或其他事件的適用路徑，不能把本法第14條的申訴期限直接套用到所有事件。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第1條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"1","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:1"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=1","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-N0030014-32-1","content":"性別平等工作法第32條之1：受僱者或求職者遭受性騷擾，應向雇主提起申訴；被申訴人屬最高負責人或僱用人、雇主未處理，或不服被申訴人之雇主所為調查或懲戒結果者，得逕向地方主管機關申訴。依前述但書向地方主管機關申訴，期限按被申訴人是否具權勢地位區分：被申訴人非具權勢地位，自知悉性騷擾時起逾二年不予受理，自該行為終了時起逾五年亦同；被申訴人具權勢地位，自知悉性騷擾時起逾三年不予受理，自該行為終了時起逾七年亦同。兩個特別情形：性騷擾發生時申訴人為未成年者，得於成年之日起三年內申訴；被申訴人為最高負責人或僱用人者，申訴人得於離職之日起一年內申訴，但行為終了逾十年不予受理。只有這兩個特別情形不受前述一般期限限制；若依一般期限規定有較長申訴期限，從一般期限規定。這些是本條向地方主管機關申訴的期限，不是所有向雇主申訴或刑事告訴的期限。公務、教育、軍職人員是否適用本條另須核對同法第2條。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等工作法第32條之1（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等工作法","law_code":"N0030014","article_number":"32-1","lookup_keys":["性別平等工作法:32-1"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=N0030014&flno=32-1","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=N0030014","related_source_urls":["https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=N0030014&flno=2"],"version":"N0030014@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2024-03-08","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2024-03-08","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-H0080067-31","content":"性別平等教育法第31條：校園性別事件被害人、法定代理人或實際照顧者，得以書面向行為人所屬學校申請調查；行為人現為或曾為校長時，向學校主管機關申請。任何知悉事件者得依程序檢舉。此條規定首次申請的對象與方式，未寫首次申請須於三十日內提出。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等教育法第31條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等教育法","law_code":"H0080067","article_number":"31","lookup_keys":["性別平等教育法:31"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=H0080067&flno=31","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0080067","version":"H0080067@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-H0080067-32","content":"性別平等教育法第32條：學校或主管機關接獲校園性別事件的調查申請或檢舉，應於二十日內以書面通知是否受理。不受理須敘明理由。未於該期限收到通知，或收到不受理通知時，申請人、被害人或檢舉人得依本條規定於二十日內書面申復。這些是受理通知及不受理申復的期限，非首次申請調查的期限。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等教育法第32條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等教育法","law_code":"H0080067","article_number":"32","lookup_keys":["性別平等教育法:32"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=H0080067&flno=32","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0080067","version":"H0080067@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-H0080067-36","content":"性別平等教育法第36條：校園性別事件受理後，性別平等教育委員會原則上於二個月內完成調查；必要時最多延長二次，每次不超過一個月並通知當事人。學校或主管機關接獲調查報告後，另有二個月作成或移送議處並書面通知結果。這是機關處理時程，非被害人首次申請調查的期限。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等教育法第36條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等教育法","law_code":"H0080067","article_number":"36","lookup_keys":["性別平等教育法:36"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=H0080067&flno=36","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0080067","version":"H0080067@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-H0080067-37","content":"性別平等教育法第37條：申請人、被害人及行為人對第36條第3項的處理結果不服，得於收到書面通知次日起三十日內，以書面具明理由向學校或主管機關申復；特定校長、教師、職員或工友案件，申請人或被害人得逕向主管機關申復。這個三十日是收到處理結果後的申復期限，不能說成首次申請調查期限。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性別平等教育法第37條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性別平等教育法","law_code":"H0080067","article_number":"37","lookup_keys":["性別平等教育法:37"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=H0080067&flno=37","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=H0080067","version":"H0080067@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2024-03-08","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2024-03-08","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-D0050074-25","content":"性騷擾防治法第25條：意圖性騷擾，乘人不及抗拒而親吻、擁抱或觸摸臀部、胸部或其他身體隱私處，須核對本條的具體行為要件；第2項明定第1項之罪須告訴乃論。工作場所與校園事件另有性別平等工作法第38條之4及性別平等教育法第45條轉用本條。單憑性騷擾的稱呼、言語或尚未完成的接觸，不足以直接認定本罪及其刑事告訴期間。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"性騷擾防治法第25條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"性騷擾防治法","law_code":"D0050074","article_number":"25","lookup_keys":["性騷擾防治法:25"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=D0050074&flno=25","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0050074","related_source_urls":["https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=N0030014&flno=38-4","https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=H0080067&flno=45"],"version":"D0050074@2023-08-16","law_modified_date":"2023-08-16","article_effective_date":"2023-08-16","checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","effective_date":"2023-08-16","effective_date_scope":"reviewed_current_article_text_not_first_enactment"}}
{"doc_id":"law-C0010001-237","content":"刑事訴訟法第237條：只有確認具體罪名屬於告訴乃論時，告訴應自得為告訴之人知悉犯人之時起六個月內為之；有數名告訴權人者，一人遲誤不及於其他人。本條不是所有刑事案件的報案、偵查或追訴期限，也不能代替行政申訴期限。先核對具體罪名、告訴乃論性質、告訴權人與知悉犯人的日期。","metadata":{"data_type":"law","document_type":"law","source":"刑事訴訟法第237條（官方法源摘要）","law_name":"刑事訴訟法","law_code":"C0010001","article_number":"237","lookup_keys":["刑事訴訟法:237"],"source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawSingle.aspx?pcode=C0010001&flno=237","law_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=C0010001","version":"C0010001@2026-05-13","law_modified_date":"2026-05-13","article_effective_date":null,"checked_at":"2026-11-10","article_status":"published","corpus_active":true,"jurisdiction":"台灣","review_status":"official_source_paraphrase_not_case_gold","revision_source_url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawHistory.aspx?pcode=C0010001","effective_date":null,"effective_date_scope":"article_history_not_verified"}}
